-- so the medium is chemistry: the handedness of the environment is computed from which constituents are
-- chiral and in excess, and the rate of a change is read from which constituents are present. What this
-- layer still owes is matching the tag to the motion, so that a constituent catalyses the change it
-- actually catalyses rather than every change at once, and concentrations that act as numbers rather than
-- as presence -- a rate depends on how much base there is, not only on whether there is any.
medium-is-chemistry : (a : count-in sp-glycerol (sit-in 30 0 mix-pirkle) ≡ count-in sp-glycerol (sit-in 30 0 mix-racemic) → Empty) × (count-in sp-glucose (sit-in 30 1 mix-water) ≡ count-in sp-glucose (sit-in 30 1 mix-base) → Empty)
medium-is-chemistry = (racemic-does-not-separate , λ q → transport (λ i → isTrue (eqb 2 ((concat (sym mix-glu-water) (concat q mix-glu-base)) i))) unit)
